invariant: INV-26
file: gcm.c
catches: quic_test
builds: bin/quic_test
reason: gcm_open runs counter mode over the bytes the whole passes left
  before GHASH hashes them. An open into a second buffer cannot show the
  difference; an open in place, which quic_packet.c's is, hashes the
  plaintext it just wrote over the ciphertext and refuses every genuine
  packet. Under AES=soft no whole pass exists, so the whole payload is
  that rest. bin/quic_test opens RFC 9001's Initial packets in place and
  requires them to open.

--- old
    ghash_data(k, h.acc, h.subkey, &ct[done], n - done);
    counter_mode(k, counter, &ct[done], n - done, &pt[done]);
--- new
    counter_mode(k, counter, &ct[done], n - done, &pt[done]);
    ghash_data(k, h.acc, h.subkey, &ct[done], n - done);
